WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.127
Week 32: Work, Technology, and Formal Communication. summarize a meeting write a professional message explain a technical problem and next action

2
00:00:10.127 --> 00:00:24.481
Operational objective. By the end of this section you can summarize a meeting, write a professional message, explain a technical problem and next action. The focus is useful performance, not isolated terminology.

3
00:00:24.481 --> 00:00:32.731
Language system. Reported speech; reciprocal constructions; stressed possessives; formal connectors and nominal style.

4
00:00:32.731 --> 00:00:40.235
Sound and delivery. Chunk information-dense speech and articulate acronyms, numbers, and borrowed terms.

5
00:00:40.235 --> 00:00:49.767
Core principle. Notice meaning first, then form. Retrieve the new language aloud, compare it with the model, and repair one feature at a time.

6
00:00:49.767 --> 00:01:21.572
Model language. Según la técnica, la red ya funciona. — According to the technician, the network is working. Nos comunicamos por un canal seguro. — We communicate through a secure channel. El director dijo que ampliarían el plazo. — The director said that they would extend the deadline. Adjunto encontrará el informe solicitado. — Attached you will find the requested report. Con respecto al incidente, faltan dos datos. — Regarding the incident, two details are missing.

7
00:01:21.572 --> 00:01:31.726
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
